exports[`yukioshi CLI help-text snapshots every documented command emits stable help text: yukioshi schedule add --help 1`] = `
"yukioshi schedule add <cron> <prompt>

schedule a prompt to run on a recurring cron schedule

Positionals:
  cron    5-field cron expression in local time: minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week
                                                                                 [string] [required]
  prompt  prompt to execute on schedule                                          [string] [required]

Options:
  -h, --help        show help                                                              [boolean]
  -v, --version     show version number                                                    [boolean]
      --print-logs  print logs to stderr                                                   [boolean]
      --log-level   log level                   [string] [choices: "DEBUG", "INFO", "WARN", "ERROR"]
      --pure        run without external plugins                                           [boolean]
      --name        display name for the scheduled task                                     [string]
      --dir         target directory for task execution (defaults to current directory)     [string]
      --model       model to execute the prompt with (provider/model)                       [string]
      --agent       agent mode to execute with                                              [string]
      --auto        automatically approve permission requests during runs [boolean] [default: false]
      --review      have a small model approve or refuse each action that is not low-risk
                    (permission mode review)                              [boolean] [default: false]

Examples:
  yukioshi schedule add "0 9 * * 1-5" "summarize      every weekday at 09:00
  recent commits"
  yukioshi schedule add "*/30 * * * *" "check the     every 30 minutes in a given folder
  build" --dir ~/code/app"
`;

